  "text": "proprium.purificatio-beatae-mariae-virginis-epistola",
  "about": "The epistola of the formulary “Purification of the Blessed Virgin Mary” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Thus says the Lord God: “Behold, I send My angel, and he shall prepare the way before My face. And at once the Ruler, whom you seek, shall come to His temple, and the Angel of the covenant, whom you desire. Behold, He comes, says the Lord of hosts. And who shall be able to think of the day of His coming, and who shall stand to see Him? For He is like a refining fire, and like the fullers’ herb; and He shall sit refining and cleansing silver, and He shall purge the sons of Levi and purify them like gold and like silver; and they shall be offering sacrifices to the Lord in justice. And the sacrifice of Juda and of Jerusalem shall please the Lord, as in days long past and as in the ancient years, says the Lord almighty.”" }
  },
